# ── Required ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nimble API key — powers all three acts (nimble_research + web_search).
# Get one at https://nimbleway.com  →  https://online.nimbleway.com/settings/api-keys
NIMBLE_API_KEY=your-nimble-api-key

# ── Model credentials — you need TWO VENDORS ─────────────────────────────────
# Act 2 runs one Claude head and one GPT head. Act 3's cross-review REQUIRES a
# reviewer from a different vendor than the implementer. One vendor is not enough.
#
# You can satisfy this WITHOUT paid API accounts: if you are already logged in to
# the Claude Code CLI and the Codex CLI, Omnigent uses those subscriptions and you
# can leave both keys below unset. Check with `omnigent config list`.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...     # optional — the Claude Code CLI login also works
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...       # optional — the Codex CLI login also works
